  <Properties>
    <blocks>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "30a0d072-7837-449e-9db2-228afed80595",
      "key": "b0b59fca-72ca-463c-a956-fd0bee742b9e",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EHello Cavalier Community,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EMy name is Nick Clark, and I am truly honored to serve as the new principal of Santiago High School. I am excited to continue our proud traditions, celebrate our academic achievements, and build on the incredible impact our programs have on our students and community.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003ESupporting GGUSD Goal 1: Academic Skills\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EIn alignment with GGUSD Goal 1, Santiago High School was named a California Distinguished School at the end of the 2025\u201326 school year for our continued academic progress. We offer a wide range of rigorous pathways to ensure every student succeeds including Early College Academy (ECA) partnership with Santa Ana College and students enrolled in our Advanced Placement courses have a 76% pass rate. As an AVID National Demonstration School and a designated Community School, we provide the structured support and extended learning opportunities students need to master challenging coursework.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EA Safe, Welcoming, and Supportive Environment (GGUSD Goal 2: Personal Skills)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003ESantiago High School is committed to caring for the whole child, because social-emotional well-being is just as important as academic success. Designated as a \u0022No Place for Hate\u0022 campus, SHS provides a welcoming community where students can get involved through over 40 clubs and 15 athletic sports. Additionally, we offer high-quality mental health resources and specialized support services, including our valuable partnership with Project Kinship.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EGGUSD Goal 3: Lifelong Success: Preparing Civic-Minded Leaders for Every Future\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EWhether our students are heading to a university, entering a career, or serving our country, we ensure they leave SHS as critical thinkers prepared for life after high school. SHS boasts a 95% graduation rate, with more than half of our students meeting the A\u2013G requirements for CSU and UC eligibility. Over 700 students have completed two-year Career Technical Education (CTE) pathways, while our JROTC program prepares students who choose to serve our nation by joining the military.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EWorking alongside our students, families, staff, alumni, and community partners, I know we will make this another incredible year.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003EHere\u0027s to honoring our traditions while embracing new opportunities!\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\u0022\u003E\uD83D\uDC9C #GoCavaliers\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
